emale":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029748006:0":{"text":"大丈夫だ、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>様の魔法があれば、これぐらいの寒さはどうってことない！","source_cn":"你们放心，有<style=stress><player...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD3CD6BC2DF2EB5EB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"大丈夫だ、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>様の魔法があれば、これぐらいの寒さはどうってことない！","female":"大丈夫だ、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>様の魔法があれば、これぐらいの寒さはどうってことない！","variant_male_record_index":"102786","variant_female_record_index":"102787","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029748007:1":{"text":"早速紹介しよう。こちらはミスリル商会のロワン坊ちゃんと、ラスティーアンカーの船長、シンドバッドだ――","source_cn":"我来给你们介绍，这次来的就是秘银商会的罗万少爷，还有锈...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4282F4F9B9D9C544","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029748008:0":{"text":"フーキンのやや大袈裟な紹介が終わり、互いに挨拶を交わした後、あなたたちは今回の来訪の目的を告げた……","source_cn":"在呼金多少有点夸张的介绍下，你们彼此寒暄之后，说明了来意——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F73B1E26FCB857C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029748009:0":{"text":"というわけで、オイラはミスリル商会を代表して、この場所と安定した交易関係を築きたいんだ。","source_cn":"——简而言之，我代表秘银商会来到此处，是希望能够建立起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF36D0161F5272AF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1029748010:0":{"text":"それに、スノーシダー町は観光客の受け入れに関して、すでに十分な経験を持ってるから、観光事業も同時進行できる